      "releaseNotes": "We regularly update Flightradar24 in order to bring you the best flight-tracking experience. In this latest update you'll find:\nWe've added the ability to share upcoming flights. Choose a scheduled flight from the airport, aircraft, or flight panel and tap share.\nBug fixes and performance improvements\nEnjoy using Flightradar24? Rate the app and leave a review!",
      "trackId": 382233851,
      "trackName": "Flightradar24 | Flight Tracker",
