      "releaseNotes": "We regularly update Flightradar24 in order to bring you the best flight-tracking experience. In this latest update you'll find:\n\nOur new Airport flight history panel allows you to access up to 365 days of past landings and takeoffs for airports around the world.\n\nWe've added the ability to share upcoming flights. Choose a scheduled flight from the airport, aircraft, or flight panel and tap share.\n\nBug fixes and performance improvements\n\nEnjoy using Flightradar24? Rate the app and leave a review!",
